  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supportive Contribution PSSN (51170070):          TASAF System Review - Supportive Contribution PSSN: TASAF System Review</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Supportive Contribution PSSN (51170070):          TASAF System Review</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The call-off is a supplement to the previous KPMG assignment to do a limited system review of TASAF, the authority implementing the Tanzania&apos;s Productive Social Safety Net Programme (PSSN). The previous call-off, which was based on decision DAR 79/2015, was signed with KPMG 6 November 2015. Due to circumstances beyond the control of KPMG the assignment could not be completed during the allotted time. Therefore, an additional call-off is made with KPMG, which will allow KPMG to take care of the ToR&#x2019;s outstanding matter of verifying whether TASAF&#x2019;s accounting is based on adequate documentation.

The proposed budget is acceptable. It includes US $ 2,032 for fees and USD 366 for the VAT. Together with the original call-off which was of USD 14,143 the total budget is USD 16 541. Payment for the original and additional call-offs will be done together after completion of additional call-off and the receipt of approved reporting.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Uppdraget &#xe4;r ett till&#xe4;ggsuppdrag till ett tidigare uppdrag &#xe5;t KPMG f&#xf6;r att g&#xf6;ra en begr&#xe4;nsad system&#xf6;versyn av TASAF, den myndighet som genomf&#xf6;r Tanzanias Productive Social Safety Net programme (PSSN). Det tidigare avropet enligt beslut DAR 79/2015, undertecknades med KPMG 6 november 2015. P&#xe5; grund av omst&#xe4;ndigheter bortom KPMGs kontroll kunde inte uppdraget slutf&#xf6;ras under den anvisade tiden. D&#xe4;rf&#xf6;r g&#xf6;rs ytterligare ett avrop med KPMG som kommer att till&#xe5;ta KPMG att ta hand om uppdragsbeskrivningens uttest&#xe5;ende fr&#xe5;ga om att verifiera TASAFs redovisning baseras p&#xe5; tillfredsst&#xe4;llande dokumentation.

Den f&#xf6;reslagna budgeten &#xe4;r acceptabel, vilket inkluderar USD 2 032 f&#xf6;r arvoden och USD 366 f&#xf6;r moms. Tillsammans med det ordinarie uppdraget vilket var p&#xe5; USD 14 143 s&#xe5; hamnar den totala budgeten p&#xe5; USD 16 541. Betalning huvuduppdrag och till&#xe4;ggsuppdrag kommer att ske tillsammans efter fullgjort till&#xe4;ggsuppdrag och godk&#xe4;nd rapportering.</narrative>
  </description>
